aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.title = Building settings
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.short = Settings
aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.hint = Set treasury gold cost, self build days, style, prefab empty spaces, plot token lock, and optionally submit to the community marketplace.

aetherhaven.plotcreator.step.CONFIGURE.detail = Gold is paid from the town treasury when the plot is built. Self build days is how long the plot takes to finish without a building staff. Style groups your building in the plot crafting bench. Save empty spaces controls whether air in your footprint is saved to clear blocks when built. Plot token locked requires players to unlock this plot at the plot crafting bench before they can craft tokens.

