aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.maxHomeResidents = Max residents (1-8)

aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces = Save empty spaces in prefab
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.saveEmptySpaces.hint = When on, air in your footprint is saved and clears those blocks when the building is assembled. When off, only solid blocks are saved and existing terrain is kept. Editor empty markers always clear blocks.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.preserveWater = Keep water when building
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.preserveWater.hint = When on, water stays in prefab air spaces outside the build. Editor empty markers still clear water so you can hollow out interiors.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination = Visitors may stop here
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.touristDestination.hint = When on, portal visitors may walk to this building during the day.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked = Plot token locked by default
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.plotTokenLocked.hint = When on, players must unlock this plot at the plot crafting bench (using a plot blueprint) before they can craft plot tokens for it.
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.floatingGiftBlueprint = Balloon plot blueprint
aetherhaven.plotcreator.field.floatingGiftBlueprint.hint = When on, regular (white) balloon gifts can drop a plot blueprint for this building. Requires plot token locked.
